From a5563e8b8442331ead717febc490ab1eeef5594c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Sep 2025 15:16:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] PENDING: dmaengine: gpi: Add new API to enhance CCU QUP
 features

Introduce a new API to support CCU QUP features, including
multi-slave arbitration, priority data transfer in GSI mode,
updating the channel CCU mode and type of GPII, premature
cancel feature, static gpii and noop TRE support.

Change-Id: I24a3d02b175d514c88922d7c1b313db8cd158e22
Signed-off-by: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
